[I] Small and simple music tag editor

[T] Ear Tag is a simple audio file tag editor. It is primarily geared towards
[T] making quick edits or bulk-editing tracks in albums/EPs. Unlike other
[T] tagging programs, Ear Tag does not require the user to set up a music
[T] library folder.

[U] https://github.com/knuxify/eartag

[A] Eartag Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

